I would like to propose a default "Match display template" including ${diff}. This setting can be accessed by Preferences, TM Matches. Current default does not show what characters are missing. What I propose is: ${id}. <${score}/${noStemScore}/${adjustedScore}% ${fuzzyFlag} ${fileNameOnly} ${diff} ${targetText} This displays like Trados so many people can move from it, making OmegaT the industry

